	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "no-Bst_WQk3mrz_NI",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 22, DX 13, IQ 4, HT 12, HP 22, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 12, SPEED 6.25, MOVE 9, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nrfwp2N_NoCTS5TjE",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 34 (offense 19, protection 15), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
