			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/tiger.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nkofDvIqXOAd0tfOq",
			"text": "Independent build total: 26 points of racial traits plus 17 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nhry1yVufVwFgNbQ1",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Tiger (SRD 5.1); Tiger (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nMbO3LL9XJnEKB2G_",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nuou3Z-x6Ojnq8tR_",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6, 9 at a sprint (primary). The published Move folds this creature's Enhanced Move into a single figure."
		},
		{
